When I started making videos about AI a year ago, I never thought there would be so much interest and so many of you wanting to learn how to make your own movies using generative tools. I was blown away by the response, but also kept finding that I couldn't keep up with the demand for new deep dives and workflow explorations on my channel because I was still working full time as a visual effects artist (and that is usually more than a full time job).
With your support on Patreon you help me a lot to be able to take more time for new and more awesome videos and I'm really looking forward to get started. My list of topics and ideas is already very long and getting longer every day.
I'd like to build a small AI filmmaking community here on Patreon, and soon on our exclusive Discord, to support each other's projects, share new ideas, and showcase our results. 
In return, you'll get exclusive insights into my work, have a say in new video topics, and get access to my notes in the form of workflow sheets where I clearly summarize my work on YouTube videos, successes and failures, and additional notes when researching for my videos in step-by-step instructions. The first one for my new video, which will be released tomorrow is coming early next week!
Please give me some time to set everything up, because I'm still working on two new videos in parallel, which will come very soon!
Until then, I look forward to meeting you in my Discord channel soon, and all that's left to say for is: 
THANK YOU! ❤️